Fixed text, alert, table header, badge and form control colors that did not meet WCAG AA contrast minimums in light or dark mode.
Fixed icon-only controls, modal dialogs, Select2 fields, table row checkboxes and the global search bar having no accessible name.
Fixed form field help text and validation errors not being announced by screen readers.
Fixed data tables missing header scopes, sort state and an accessible name.
Fixed skipped heading levels and invalid list markup that stopped page structure being reported correctly.
Fixed bulk-action controls remaining reachable by keyboard while visually hidden.
Fixed images missing `alt` attributes, and re-enabled the djlint accessibility rules that allowed that to happen.
